{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Third plan-review remediation: separated normal classifier fallbacks from classifier-job failure. Logical uncertainty emits route=full. A failed/cancelled classifier job triggers full-route jobs through always()+result gating, prevents docs-only execution, and still blocks Verified. Also named the parameterized classifier test suite and gating command for every path/error category."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786725397371893001,"uuid":"3a790b77-405d-4ddc-ba4b-6f03a7fe73d0"}